3. FCFS CPU Scheduling

Aim:
To implement the First Come First Served (FCFS) CPU scheduling algorithm using C.

Pseudocode:

START
    Read number of processes
    Read burst time of each process
    Set waiting time of first process = 0
    FOR each remaining process
        Calculate waiting time
    END FOR
    Calculate turnaround time
    Calculate average waiting time
    Calculate average turnaround time
    Display results
STOP

Result:
Thus, FCFS CPU scheduling was successfully implemented and the waiting time and turnaround time were calculated.

