6. Pre-emptive Priority Scheduling

Aim:
To implement the pre-emptive priority CPU scheduling algorithm using C.

Pseudocode:

START
    Read processes, burst times and priorities
    Set remaining burst time
    FOR every unit of CPU time
        Select the highest-priority available process
        Execute it for one time unit
        Update remaining burst time
    END FOR
    Calculate waiting and turnaround times
    Display results
STOP

Result:
Thus, pre-emptive priority scheduling was successfully implemented.

