Pseudocode:

START
    Read number of processes
    Read burst times
    Select the process with the smallest burst time
    Execute it completely
    Select the next shortest process
    Repeat until all processes are completed
    Calculate waiting and turnaround times
    Display results
STOP

Result:
Thus, the non-preemptive SJF scheduling algorithm was successfully implemented.

8. Round Robin Scheduling

Aim:
To implement the Round Robin CPU scheduling algorithm using C.

Pseudocode:

START
    Read number of processes
    Read burst times
    Read time quantum
    Place all processes in ready queue
    WHILE processes remain
        Select process from queue
        Execute for time quantum or remaining burst time
        Update remaining burst time
        IF process is incomplete
            Add it back to queue
        END IF
    END WHILE
    Calculate waiting and turnaround times
STOP

Result:
Thus, the Round Robin scheduling algorithm was successfully implemented.

