12. Dining Philosophers Problem

Aim:
To simulate the Dining Philosophers synchronization problem using C.

Pseudocode:

START
    Create philosophers
    Create one fork for each philosopher
    REPEAT
        Philosopher thinks
        Philosopher tries to acquire required forks
        IF both forks are available
            Philosopher eats
            Release both forks
        ELSE
            Philosopher waits
        END IF
    UNTIL execution completes
STOP

Result:
Thus, the Dining Philosophers problem was successfully simulated.

